Mushaf+ voice model files
=========================

These files are the Quran recitation models of Tarteel AI, converted to the
ONNX layout that sherpa-onnx loads, so that the installed Mushaf+ apps can
recognise a recitation on the device. Only the file layout was changed; the
weights are the original fine-tuned weights.

whisper-base-ar-quran-*   from https://huggingface.co/tarteel-ai/whisper-base-ar-quran
whisper-tiny-ar-quran-*   from https://huggingface.co/tarteel-ai/whisper-tiny-ar-quran

  Copyright Tarteel AI. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
  LICENSE). Fine-tuned from OpenAI Whisper (Copyright OpenAI, MIT License),
  whose tokenizer vocabulary the *-tokens.txt file reproduces.

Conversion: tool/voice_model/hf_to_openai.py and export_sherpa.py in
https://github.com/salimjemai/MushafPlus, using scripts/whisper/export-onnx.py
from https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx (Copyright Xiaomi Corporation,
Apache License 2.0) and the dynamic int8 quantiser of ONNX Runtime
(Copyright Microsoft Corporation, MIT License).

